That location was chosen deliberately for its proximity to the North Gauteng High Court, the Magistrate''s Court, the Registrar of Deeds, the Master of the High Court and the Companies Office, putting the firm within easy reach of the government and semi-government institutions its work depends on. With a second office in Knysna, EW Serfontein & Associates suits clients needing a firm that combines decades of institutional history with day-to-day proximity to Pretoria''s key legal and government offices.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://ewsattorneys.co.za/about'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'ew-serfontein-associates-inc-de-wilgers' AND description = 'EW Serfontein and Associates Inc is a Pretoria-based law firm, with a second office in Knysna, specialising in conveyancing, civil litigation, commercial law, sectional titles, company law, debt collection, family law, RAF claims, insolvency and municipal disputes. Director Ernst Serfontein has practised commercial law for over 33 years and has served as an arbitrator for sectional title disputes.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
-- jj-plates-and-signs-boekenhoutskloof (researched)
