Beyond number plates, the business offers rubber stamps, glazing and doming, laser engraving, digital printing, sublimation, canvas and mug printing, block mounting, signage, safety signs, banners, pull-up banners, graphic design, business cards, flyers and key cutting, making it a broader signage and printing stop rather than a single-purpose plate shop. JJ Plates and Signs has built a reputation for more than 15 years on quick turnaround and straightforward service, with customers consistently rating their experience highly for fitment and plate quality.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.newnumberplates.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jj-plates-and-signs-boekenhoutskloof' AND description = 'JJ Plates and Signs has been a recognised name in the number plate industry for more than 15 years, manufacturing number plates for all South African provinces alongside signage, vinyl printing, vehicle wrapping and screen printing; the Wonderboom South premises also offer key duplication, embroidery, vehicle licence disc renewals, roadworthy testing and a car wash and valet service.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
